None known. Keep this type path separate from #414's multidimensional packed-array bounds and #429's indexed class-array members.

## Gap

The matrix records a remaining multidimensional packed computed-base path where an inner out-of-bounds index can alias a neighboring outer slice; some leading non-integral indices are also not rejected. Make each dimension's bounds and index-type checks follow the LRM before selecting the packed value.

## Reproducer: out-of-bounds alias

```systemverilog
module t;
  logic [1:0][7:0] words;
  integer outer, inner;
  logic got;
  initial begin
    words = 16'h8101; // words[1][0] = 1
    outer = 0;
    inner = 8;
    got = words[outer][inner];
    $display("inner_oob=%b", got);
  end
endmodule
```

Expected: `inner_oob=x`. A local source-built ARM64 compiler from the #460 branch, based on `origin/main` `af89cfc50`, prints `inner_oob=1`: `words[0][8]` aliases adjacent element `words[1][0]`.

