## Scope

First SVA phase: immediate assertions (no scheduler change needed) and single-step concurrent properties.

### In scope
- Immediate \`assert (expr) else \$error(...)\` — compile to runtime check, print message on failure
- Immediate \`assume\`, \`cover\` statements
- \`assert property (@(posedge clk) antecedent |-> consequent)\` — single-cycle implication
- \`\$rose(sig)\`, \`\$fell(sig)\`, \`\$stable(sig)\`, \`\$past(sig)\` sampling functions
- \`\$sampled(expr)\` — sample at clock edge
- Failure message: print file/line, failing expression string

### Out of scope
- Sequence operators \`##N\`, repetition — Phase 14
- \`disable iff\`
- \`expect\` statement

